      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank you for implementing Stream Resolution in the Open Beta.\n\nI would like to inform you that 7680x4320 via Config File is not working.\n\nI understand that the 8K button is not implemented out of consideration for people with low PC specifications, but it would be helpful if you could provide a way to make it 8K.",
