      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "registry value \"USER_CAMERA_STREAM_RESOLUTION_h3118717280\", values ​​\"0 to 3\" function as \"720p to 4K\", value \"5\" functions as \"Config File\", but value \"4\" seems to be undefined, so if you could set value \"4\" to 8K, only power users who need it be able to use 8K, and could continue to be considerate of those with low PC specs, as the 8K button GUI has not yet been implemented.\n\nwould appreciate your consideration.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
