  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-10T10:54:25.088Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Choose any resolution\n\nI'd like a way to select, like in the \"Photo Resolution\" menu.\n\nI often video record at 7680x4320. https://youtu.be/cQglMEu8r5A\n\n2. Move the \"Spout Stream\" switch to the \"Camera Mode\" menu\n\nThe current stream camera has the \"Spout Stream\" switch to the left of the \"Flying\" switch, so the \"Behavior\" menu is pushed out and cannot be accessed immediately.\n\nPlease consider it.",
